{{Short description|Chemical data page}}
This page provides supplementary data and solvent coefficients for linear [[free-energy relationship]]s.

==Partition between water and organic solvents==
The LFER used to obtain [[partition coefficient]]s that uses the systems below takes the form log P<sub>s</sub> = c + eE + sS + aA + bB + vV

